<title>UK: IFC sets 150 million rand three-year bond. [CORRECTED 16:35 GMT]</title>
<headline>IFC sets 150 million rand three-year bond. [CORRECTED 16:35 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager BZW.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTERNATIONAL FINANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN RAND  COUPON     14.75 PCT MATURITY    07.MAR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.2875  PAY DATE    07.MAR.97</p>
<p>(Corrects ISS PRICE from 101.28.)</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	REOFFER    99.975    SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/ZA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.325     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>(corrects issue price from 101.28)</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
